    description: 'Use this if you still need to choose the right side-income model before committing to the freelancer path.',
  },
  {
    href: '/career-resources/tarzan-rule-the-exact-moment-to-quit-your-job/',
    title: 'Tarzan Rule',
    description: 'Open this when the freelance engine starts working and you need a stricter exit rule instead of emotion.',
  },
  {
    href: '/career-resources/how-indian-freelancers-make-1-5-lakh-month/',
